					PRINTFORMW 「Oohー! Since it's summer let's go swimming in the lake!」
				ELSEIF DAY:2 == 4
					PRINTFORMW 「We're going to the lake in this cold weather!? This is madness!」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW 「The lake, huh... I don't really love it, but I guess it's fine if it's with you, %CALLNAME:MASTER%♪」
				ENDIF
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「The lake, huh... I don't really love it, but I guess it's fine～」
			ENDIF
