			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Whahuh? You wanna go to Hell? Wouldn't it be better to not?」
			ENDIF
		CASE "妖怪の山 (山麓)"
			PRINTFORMW 「Really, hiking? Picnicking?」
		CASE "妖怪の山 (山頂)"
			IF GROUPMATCH(MAIN_MAP, 7, 9, 10)
				PRINTFORMW 「Really, hiking? Picnicking?」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Whahuh? %CALLNAME:MASTER%, aren't we gonna take the cable car? Well, it's fine I guess...」
